## Layer model

Dependencies point one way only: a layer may import from layers below it, never above.

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    UI["UI / Interface"] --> RT["Runtime / Transport"]
    RT --> SV["Service (business logic)"]
    SV --> RP["Repo (data access)"]
    RP --> CF["Config"]
    TY["Types (shared, no dependencies)"] -.-> UI
    TY -.-> RT
    TY -.-> SV
    TY -.-> RP
```

## Trust boundaries

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    U["User / Client"] -->|untrusted input| E["Edge: validate + authenticate"]
    E --> S["Application services"]
    S --> D[("Datastore")]
    S --> X["Third-party APIs"]
```

