## Golden principles

Enforced mechanically by `{{GOLDEN}}` (also runs in CI).

| ID | Principle | Enforced by |
|----|-----------|-------------|
| GP-1 | `AGENTS.md` is a map, under 150 lines | line count |
| GP-2 | All 7 top-level docs exist | file existence |
| GP-3 | Diagrams are Mermaid only: no ASCII art, PlantUML, or DOT | box-char scan, extension scan |
| GP-4 | No secrets committed; `.env` is git-ignored | pattern scan, `.gitignore` check |
| GP-5 | Active exec-plans have frontmatter with `status` | frontmatter check |
| GP-6 | Relative links in docs resolve | link check |
| GP-7 | CI declares `permissions:` and never uses floating refs (`@main`) | workflow scan |

